My dotfiles. ./install.sh symlinks every tracked top-level file to ~/.<name>
and every tracked config/<dir> to ~/.config/<dir>; untracked files are left
alone. Create ~/.secrets with the environment settings that aren't public, it
is sourced by shrc.

zsh and bash are both configured; everything they share lives in shrc.
`brew bundle` installs the tools and the font the configs refer to.
